[x] POST /oauth/token          [x] Accepts client credentials/secret, returns OAuth token.
[x] GET /users                 [x] Returns list of users (IDs and usernames).
[x] GET /users/:id             [x] Returns target user details (username, avatar, email).
[x] PATCH /users/:id           [x] Updates user profile (expects username, email, password, avatar URL).
[x] GET /movies                [x] Public endpoint; returns front-page top movie list (IDs and titles).
[x] GET /movies/:id            [x] Returns movie metadata, IMDb rating, year, duration, subtitles, comment count.
[x] GET /comments              [x] Returns latest comments (author username, date, content, ID).
[x] GET /comments/:id          [x] Returns specific comment details.
[x] POST /comments             [x] Creates comment (expects comment payload & movie_id).
[x] PATCH /comments/:id        [x] Updates comment payload.
[x] DELETE /comments/:id       [x] Deletes specific comment.
[x] HTTP ERROR HANDLING        [x] Return appropriate HTTP error status codes for unauthorized/unsupported endpoints.

